      "recordId": "not-a-lil-fish:entry:29",
      "statement": "Prefer the Nasdaq for mechanical intraday strategies; it was the dramatic winner across all assets in his mass backtest.",
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XLMG6-SATRk"
