      "recordId": "not-a-lil-fish:exit:7",
      "statement": "Consider a pure time-based exit (hold 80 minutes or 80 candles, then exit): it was the second-best exit type in his mass backtest, though its extreme outcomes clash with prop firm consistency and daily loss rules.",
